00:08:19.159 --> 00:08:24.519
This is the Insta360 ONE camera. I'm obsessed with it. It's just been so much fun

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:29.859
I'll be doing a separate video over that sometime soon. I've also got the Mavic Air batteries in here.

