00:08:38.899 --> 00:08:42.039
This is the power zoom lens that I was telling you guys about before.

00:08:42.039 --> 00:08:45.068
This is the 18-105 and because it's a power zoom lens,

00:08:45.068 --> 00:08:48.580
I love this because it's gonna be perfect for the gimbal because you won't have the lens moving in and out,

